{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The New Roads Ahead"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Settling In "}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information involving apologies, thanks, suggestions, and invitations in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Describes events that happened at work, using appropriate expressions and well-constructed simple past phrases."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Describes events that happened at work, using appropriate expressions and well-constructed simple past phrases."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le07ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Getting Involved in a Meeting"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you are at a meeting, it is important to speak at the correct time and to give your opinion in an acceptable way. You can use the Simple Present tense to express your ideas and opinions.</br></br>Sometimes the Chairperson of a meeting invites people to give their opinion. You use the Simple Present tense to introduce people in a meeting and organize the items in the agenda.</br></br>If you need to interrupt a person, use a polite expression. You use modals like can or could to interrupt someone politely.</br></br>If you agree with someone, use their name.<br>If you disagree with someone, use a polite expression."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Comments\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrupting a Person\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Agreeing and Disagreeing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Does anyone have feedback?</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Is there any discussion on this point?</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Please speak up.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Pardon me for interrupting.</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I make a comment?</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I have the floor, please?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I agree with Helen.</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's a good idea.</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I must say I disagree. </span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, but we need to ...</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you give us more detail about \u2026 ?</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you tell us \u2026 ?</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Thank you for your presentation. Does anyone have feedback for Ms. Major?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Is there any discussion on this point? If not, can we vote?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "feedback"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "comments and questions after a presentation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Does anyone have feedback for Ms. Major?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear at a meeting."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "discussion"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "talking on a subject"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Is there any discussion on this subject?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to vote"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to choose one option"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If there is no more discussion, we will vote."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to speak up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give your opinion"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please, speak up if you disagree. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have the floor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have permission to speak at a meeting"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have the floor. Please speak."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to agree"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have the same opinion"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I agree with Carol. We need to monitor our budget."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to disagree"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have a different opinion"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I must say I disagree."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Complete the sentences with the missing words. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Prepare 4 more sentences with missing words. Give your sentences to a partner to find the missing words."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is there any _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ on this topic? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ of today's meeting? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes, you can _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do we need to _ _ _ _ on this item?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\